{"id":38538,"date":"2024-11-24T08:35:19","date_gmt":"2024-11-24T07:35:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=38538"},"modified":"2026-08-24T10:04:38","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T09:04:38","slug":"trail-do-texugo-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-texugo-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Texugo 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O Trail do Texugo \u00e9 uma prova de Trail Running, corrida pedestre em Natureza, com quatro dist\u00e2ncias, Trail Ultra (TU) K46+ , Trail Longo (TL) K31+ , Trail Sprint (TS) K17+ e Inicia\u00e7\u00e3o ao Trail 10Km.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>A prova ter\u00e1 in\u00edcio e fim na Aldeia da Serra D&#8217;Ossa percorrendo trilhos, estrad\u00f5es, caminhos florestais, corta-fogos, singletracks, com passagem por ribeiros e locais com interesse hist\u00f3rico.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>O evento visa a promo\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica e ambiental da regi\u00e3o e a promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio natural. A prova decorre maioritariamente em meio rural, por caminhos e trilhos de terra batida.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":39859,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672],"event_type_2":[132,728],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-38538","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-redondo-evora","event_type-trail","event_type-caminhada","event_type_2-evora","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/471620833_1166422175070780_3705529840574984014_n-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\